---
/**
 * Cross-link to the sibling project, The Email Specification. Painted in that
 * site's purple (not our green) so the pair reads as one family; the mirror
 * banner on specification.email is painted in our green.
 */
---

<aside
  class="no-print mt-24 border-y border-sibling-200 bg-sibling-50"
  aria-label="Related specification"
  data-pagefind-ignore
>
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-10 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-sibling-500 uppercase">
        Also in the specification family
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-900">
        Sending email too?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm text-ink-600">
        Explore The Email Specification: a platform-agnostic guide to what a
        good email does.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 self-start rounded-md bg-sibling-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-sibling-700 md:self-auto"
      href="https://specification.email"
      rel="external"
    >
      Visit specification.email →
    </a>
  </div>
</aside>
